**Covers** are full-bleed with no padding wrapper, so their content would have run straight under the footer. Both [CoverBody](src/components/print/course-paper.tsx#L1155) and [CoverBodyClassic](src/components/print/course-paper.tsx#L1257) now use `max(padTop*0.95, footerFloor(40))` as bottom padding.

