```
a4/narrow   footer=25..45   above=25 below=25
a4/normal   footer=27..47   above=37 below=27
a5/narrow   footer=25..45   above=25 below=25
b5/normal   footer=25..45   above=26 below=25
cover       footer=40..60   above=25 below=40
ALL OK (12/12)
```

Narrow margins were the tight case — they previously put the footer 20px off the sheet edge and let content stop only 17px above it; both are now held at 25.

